# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a ZNE program containing circuits of increasing noise scales. Each noise factor represents the multiple of entangling gates that the circuit contains (noise factor of ``3.0`` holds three times more entangling gates than the original circuit). Each noise factor's circuit is twirled with the same number of randomizations and shots as the unmitigated program.\n"
msgstr "Maghanda ng ZNE program na naglalaman ng mga circuit na may tumataas na noise scale. Kumakatawan ang bawat noise factor sa multiple ng mga entangling gate na taglay ng circuit (ang noise factor na ``3.0`` ay may tatlong beses na mas maraming entangling gate kaysa sa orihinal na circuit). Ang circuit ng bawat noise factor ay tini-twirl gamit ang parehong bilang ng mga randomization at shot gaya ng unmitigated na program.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Draw the first Trotter step of the twirled template with noise factor 1 and with noise factor 3 to visualize the amplification. For noise factor 3.0, every layer of the circuit is replaced by the layer, its inverse, and the layer again.\n"
msgstr "I-draw ang unang Trotter step ng twirled na template na may noise factor 1 at may noise factor 3 para makita ang amplification. Para sa noise factor na 3.0, pinapalitan ang bawat layer ng circuit ng layer, ng inverse nito, at muli ng layer.\n"

